  "rationale": "Sections follow the StoryBrand arc hook\u2192stakes\u2192guide\u2192plan\u2192proof\u2192offer\u2192objection\u2192close. The dark photographic hero is the only inverse band and the only accent carrier (gold Melodrama 'Heartwood' set directly on the sanctioned full-bleed staircase photo). The observed dark-first rhythm then alternates primary and panel cream/espresso bands; no footer is authored (renderer appends brand chrome). PLAN and OFFER render as card runs per the rendering contract (steps, programme, ruled ticket rows with Buy-tickets arrows); PROOF pairs the press pull-quote with a three-value stat run; OBJECTION uses a four-item accordion each carrying its answer. Every display heading is uppercase Melodrama by tier, controls stay sharp-cornered, and no second accent appears \u2014 honouring the brand's never-sans-display, never-lowercase-display, and never-rounded-controls rules by construction."
